  64: /**
  65:  * The pinned CLI, invoked directly â€” no shell, no PATH lookup, no globally installed version.
  66:  * Resolved from the INSTALL root, never the (overridable) data root: the pinned versions live in
  67:  * the real checkout's `node_modules` wherever the acceptance files being read happen to be.
